    "description": {
      "value": "<p>以一个动作，你可以对距你30尺内的一名可见生物挥舞这张卡片。目标必须成功通过一次DC 17的魅力豁免，否则它会消失，被传送到位于另一个存在位面的监狱中。1分钟后，目标重新出现在离开前的空间。如果该空间被占据，则它将出现在最近的未被占据空间。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card at one creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself. The target must succeed on a [[/save ability=cha dc=17]] saving throw, or it vanishes, transported to a prison on another plane of existence. After 1 minute, the target reappears in the space it left or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
